				"name": "McNeely",
				"url": "https://indieweb.social/@McNeely",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/552/212/183/557/481/original/75a9716caf3885be.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T20:48:32.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> this is sort of like one of those a square is a rectangle but rectangular is not a square scenarios right? Progressive enhancement doesn't have to be broadly available, but broadly available features raise the baseline for progressive enhancement.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114140132400509584",
			"parentId": "114140100185222906",
			"url": "https://ruby.social/@konnorrogers/114140132356542747",
			"author": {
				"name": "Konnor Rogers",
				"url": "https://ruby.social/@konnorrogers",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/326/194/727/800/237/original/c5edef7eca753a07.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T20:56:43.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>im not sure i follow how the analogy fits.</p><p>To me its, \"if this doesn't work, what are the consequences?\"</p><p>If accent-color isnt supported, not a big deal. Colors are off, so what.</p><p>If CSS nesting isnt supported, your whole site may be borked with no way to fix it.</p><p>\"What is the blast radius, and how much of the blast radius can I prevent via things like polyfills, fallbacks, etc\"</p><p>For something like native CSS nesting, you really cant prevent it other than by not using it.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114140203151084747",
			"parentId": "114140132400509584",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114140203151084747",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T21:14:43.434Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://ruby.social/@konnorrogers\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>konnorrogers</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> right! What happens to the experience of visitors with browsers outside of the gated community of Baseline browsers?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114140220561936891",
			"parentId": "114140203151084747",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114140220561936891",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T21:19:09.102Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://ruby.social/@konnorrogers\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>konnorrogers</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> rounded corners is the classic OG example of this — we used to bend over backwards with heavy JavaScript to get rounded corners and then CSS border-radius showed up. We swapped to use the CSS method even when it was Limited Availability (to frame it in modern Baseline terms) because improving performance is a more impactful equalizer than pixel perfection</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114140258638010003",
			"parentId": "114140132400509584",
