			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T21:28:40.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://ruby.social/@konnorrogers\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>konnorrogers</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span></p><p>or looking at the blast radius from the other end:</p><p>- if a hospital website is broken, someone could die<br>- if a company website is broken, the company makes less money and maybe eventually lays people off<br>- if my personal website is broken, people need to go elsewhere for hot takes on web components</p>",
